            "review_text": "Jennifer L\n2 contributions\n0\nBad experience\nOct 2023 • Couples\nWe went to this restaurant from watching the video in our room that advertised this restaurant offer affordable beef to everyone rich or poor. We saw the menu on the video and the price seem very reasonable. We also want to try the Vietnam Waygu beef on the menu. So we decided to try out this restaurant. The restaurant didn’t not have Vietnam waygu beef on the menu. The server said the menu was old from a year ago . The manager said the menu was from 2021 and they don’t have Vietnam waygu beef now. She suggested we try the Australia waygu beef. The server informed us that they have a promotion 50% off on the beef. We asked for the bill and realized the manager didn’t adjusted the bill like they advertised. She said she forgot which seem very weird. Over all, the foods is over priced even with the discount and the foods didn’t taste that good. For the price we paid here in this restaurant, there are many high end restaurants here in Vietnam with better foods with much honest customer service.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 27, 2023",
