            "review_text": "Dan N\nHanoi, Vietnam4 contributions\n0\nExtremely poor customer service\nJan 2022 • Family\nCame here to enjoy the afternoon tea set, however I noticed there was a small bug INSIDE one of the dish. I called the supervisor there (I assume), telling her to do something to solve this problem, but she DID NOT RESPOND, and took the dish right away!! We still stayed in the restaurant for a good hour, thinking that she might come to us and apologize. But nothing happened after that; she was setting up other tables for dinner. \n\nI am so disappointed in what you called a prestigious hotel. I actually did not totally furious about the bug, I was furious about the type of service that the hotel was delivering! Beside the lady that ignored us without an apology, some other staff looked inexperienced, clumsy and they did not notice the customers' behavior in order to serve at the right time.\n\nI would never come back to this restaurant ever again.\nRead more\nWritten January 27, 2022",
