            "review_title": "Review at F29 Lounge & Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ben P\n28 contributions\n0\nexcellently crafted cocktails + delightful bar food\nApr 2021\nWell done Dolce and F29 for operating at such a high standard during these difficult times. It was a pleasure to see a list of newly created cocktails the bartenders had invented. Their recommendations were good and the cocktails executed perfectly. The bar food platter was delicious and a well thought out selection of canapés / small bites to complement the drinks.\nRead more\nWritten April 11, 2021\nDolce by Wyndham Hanoi Golden Lake\nDear Ben P, \n\nHow wonderful to hear such a kind review from you regarding your recent experience at F29 Lounge & Restaurant. \n\nWe always try our best to make sure what customers receive from us is well worth their money expectations, and we are delighted to know that you have felt so with our cocktails as well as the helpfulness of our colleagues. \n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back again in the near future! \n\nWith kindest regards,\n\nThe Hotel Management\nRead more\nWritten April 14, 2021\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
